<title>USA: Shuffle Master to sell machines in Nevada.</title>
<headline>Shuffle Master to sell machines in Nevada.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS, Minn. 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shuffle Master Inc said Monday it received approval from Nevada regulators to market its new software in a video gaming machine.</p>
<p>The company said the software improves the Let It Ride Bonus Video game by increasing the frequency of winning hands, offering improved help functions and delivering more player-friendly graphics.</p>
<p>Shuffle Master said it plans to begin selling machines made by Bally Gaming International Inc by the end of the month.</p>
<p>Shuffle Master provides products and services to the casino industry.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
